    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 29,
      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled specialists and emergency teams"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the clinical teams, emergency nurses, and board-certified specialists for their high medical expertise and thorough bedside manner. Doctors across surgery, dermatology, internal medicine, and exotics receive commendations for patient explanations and empathetic support during stressful visits, though a small number of clients felt larger hospital communications felt corporate."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Advanced care for varied animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents value the facility's extensive capabilities in handling dogs, cats, and diverse exotic species including rabbits, birds, and hedgehogs. Reviewers frequently report gentle handling during delicate eye exams, orthopedic consultations, and critical emergencies, noting that clinicians and veterinary assistants show genuine compassion toward vulnerable or stressed pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Complex interventions with variable outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers credit the hospital with life-saving interventions, praising successful orthopedic surgeries like TPLO, snake bite anti-venom treatments, and advanced dermatological solutions. However, other pet parents share heartbreak over tragic outcomes, expressing grief over failed equipment diagnostics, critical pet losses, or treatments that could not halt terminal declines."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What specialty veterinary services are available at GCVS?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "GCVS provides board-certified veterinary specialty care, including orthopedic surgery, oncology, neurology, dermatology, cardiology, internal medicine, and exotic pet care."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the hospital operate a 24/7 emergency service?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers frequently utilize the 24/7 emergency room for after-hours pet trauma, snake bites, and urgent critical care without needing prior appointments."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are treatment costs at this specialty hospital considered high?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients note that specialty diagnostics and advanced emergency procedures can be costly, though several pet owners found final charges aligned with complex surgical care."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
  ],
